{"number":95,"name":"سُورَةُ التِّينِ","englishName":"At-Tin","englishNameTranslation":"The Fig","numberOfAyahs":8,"items":[{"id":"q:95:1","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":95,"ayah":1,"surahName":"At-Tin","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"بِّسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ وَٱلتِّينِ وَٱلزَّيْتُونِ","en":"By the fig and the olive","bn":"শপথ আঞ্জীর (ডুমুর) ও যয়তুনের,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/95/1"},{"id":"q:95:2","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":95,"ayah":2,"surahName":"At-Tin","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَطُورِ سِينِينَ","en":"And [by] Mount Sinai","bn":"এবং সিনাই প্রান্তরস্থ তূর পর্বতের,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/95/2"},{"id":"q:95:3","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":95,"ayah":3,"surahName":"At-Tin","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَهَٰذَا ٱلْبَلَدِ ٱلْأَمِينِ","en":"And [by] this secure city [Makkah],","bn":"এবং এই নিরাপদ নগরীর।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/95/3"},{"id":"q:95:4","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":95,"ayah":4,"surahName":"At-Tin","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"لَقَدْ خَلَقْنَا ٱلْإِنسَٰنَ فِىٓ أَحْسَنِ تَقْوِيمٍۢ","en":"We have certainly created man in the best of stature;","bn":"আমি সৃষ্টি করেছি মানুষকে সুন্দরতর অবয়বে।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/95/4"},{"id":"q:95:5","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":95,"ayah":5,"surahName":"At-Tin","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"ثُمَّ رَدَدْنَٰهُ أَسْفَلَ سَٰفِلِينَ","en":"Then We return him to the lowest of the low,","bn":"অতঃপর তাকে ফিরিয়ে দিয়েছি নীচ থেকে নীচে।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/95/5"},{"id":"q:95:6","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":95,"ayah":6,"surahName":"At-Tin","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"إِلَّا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَعَمِلُوا۟ ٱلصَّٰلِحَٰتِ فَلَهُمْ أَجْرٌ غَيْرُ مَمْنُونٍۢ","en":"Except for those who believe and do righteous deeds, for they will have a reward uninterrupted.","bn":"কিন্তু যারা বিশ্বাস স্থাপন করেছে ও সৎকর্ম করেছে, তাদের জন্যে রয়েছে অশেষ পুরস্কার।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/95/6"},{"id":"q:95:7","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":95,"ayah":7,"surahName":"At-Tin","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"فَمَا يُكَذِّبُكَ بَعْدُ بِٱلدِّينِ","en":"So what yet causes you to deny the Recompense?","bn":"অতঃপর কেন তুমি অবিশ্বাস করছ কেয়ামতকে?","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/95/7"},{"id":"q:95:8","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":95,"ayah":8,"surahName":"At-Tin","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"أَلَيْسَ ٱللَّهُ بِأَحْكَمِ ٱلْحَٰكِمِينَ","en":"Is not Allah the most just of judges?","bn":"আল্লাহ কি বিচারকদের মধ্যে শ্রেষ্টতম বিচারক নন?","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/95/8"}]}